{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/0c52bfd2a8c66c5d6c94095250e5cc77.poster.avif?t=1768586109\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/0c52bfd2a8c66c5d6c94095250e5cc77.webm?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/0c52bfd2a8c66c5d6c94095250e5cc77.mp4?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Civilization has fallen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutants and rogue machines roam the wasteland, carrying on the chaos that destroyed the old world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But from the ashes, a new force rises: the Ecopunks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >United. Determined. Ready to heal the Earth\u2026 and crush anything that stands in their way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE OR DIE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger. Disease. Scorching heat. Freezing cold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wasteland forgives no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops, hunt, and forage to keep your people alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cure deadly illnesses\u2014if you can find the right remedies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight back against the elements with heating, cooling, and solid shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival isn\u2019t guaranteed. Prove you deserve it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/59bd46380341d463de74125045bd513a.poster.avif?t=1768586109\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/59bd46380341d463de74125045bd513a.webm?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/59bd46380341d463de74125045bd513a.mp4?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD. CRAFT. THRIVE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From ruins, build a future. From nothing, create a home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-form building: design your colony tile by tile\u2014walls, defenses, homes, the works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eight professions: cooking, tailoring, medicine, weapon-making\u2026 master them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climate control: fireplaces, AC, insulation\u2014keep the heat and cold at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfort counts: furniture, rugs, plants\u2014give your people a place worth living in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/842b21e0c712a320eeb5c146fea26c93.poster.avif?t=1768586109\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/842b21e0c712a320eeb5c146fea26c93.webm?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/842b21e0c712a320eeb5c146fea26c93.mp4?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE MOTHER TREE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is ancient. She is powerful. She is your only hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant ancient seeds to bring life back to the wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sacrifice fallen enemies to earn her blessings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal the climate, revive ecosystems, and unlock her full power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The greener the world, the stronger you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/6f95ef693ebdd129b8484e13eeecb7ee.poster.avif?t=1768586109\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/6f95ef693ebdd129b8484e13eeecb7ee.webm?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/6f95ef693ebdd129b8484e13eeecb7ee.mp4?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT FOR YOUR FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wasteland belongs to no one\u2014until you take it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mutants and rogue machines in deadly encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid enemy camps for resources. Defend your own with everything you\u2019ve got.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm your Ecopunks with one-shot pistols, heavy shotguns, armor\u2014and whatever else you can craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/f60b78493a369adf6083d50f16192406.poster.avif?t=1768586109\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/f60b78493a369adf6083d50f16192406.webm?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/f60b78493a369adf6083d50f16192406.mp4?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESEARCH &amp; EVOLVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brains win wars too. Unlock new tech, craft better weapons, and make your colony unbreakable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/f2de0350ad83c9eae4b5adcf0d484242.poster.avif?t=1768586109\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/f2de0350ad83c9eae4b5adcf0d484242.webm?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/f2de0350ad83c9eae4b5adcf0d484242.mp4?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033610?t=1768586109","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033610?t=1768586109","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/6afa529bf34e32a8b84d4915553089bccfc38d0e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768586109","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/6afa529bf34e32a8b84d4915553089bccfc38d0e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768586109","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Includes blood, violence and gore."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http